  "conclusions": [
    "quote open/high/low/close are split-adjusted to the pull date: as-traded price = Yahoo price x F(t), F(t) = product of numerator/denominator over split records effective on a later session",
    "volume is adjusted by the same factors: as-traded volume = Yahoo volume / F(t); so close x volume is traded value in as-traded dollars",
